{
  "statement_html": "<table><tr>\t<td>\tI punti \\(P\\), \\(Q\\) e \\(N\\) sono allineati e i punti \\(P\\), \\(M\\) e \\(O\\) sono come in figura. Conosciamo le seguenti lunghezze:\t<ul>\t<li>\\(P Q = 5\\) cm</li> <li> \\(P M = 20\\) cm</li> <li>\\(N Q = 9\\) cm </li><li> \\(O M = 36\\) cm</li>\t</ul>\t<b>Domanda:</b> Le rette \\(\\left(Q M\\right)\\) e \\(\\left(O N\\right)\\) sono parallele?\t</td><td>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\"><span class=\"pax-fig-group\"> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\"><line x1=\"500.00\" y1=\"200.00\" x2=\"500.00\" y2=\"200.00\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"114.29\" y1=\"200.00\" x2=\"85.71\" y2=\"0.00\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"-148.00\" y1=\"200.00\" x2=\"-148.00\" y2=\"200.00\" stroke=\"#ff0000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"348.00\" y1=\"0.00\" x2=\"68.00\" y2=\"200.00\" stroke=\"#ff0000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><text x=\"110.00\" y=\"90.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">P</text><text x=\"5.00\" y=\"70.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">O</text><text x=\"100.00\" y=\"25.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">N</text><text x=\"95.00\" y=\"170.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">Q</text><text x=\"185.00\" y=\"120.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">M</text></svg></span></div>\t<div class=\"wims_instruction\">Il disegno è indicativo e non rispetta le lunghezze dell'enunciato.</div>\t</td>\t</tr></table>\tScrivere (trascinando col mouse le etichette in basso) due rapporti di lunghezze utili per rispondere alla domanda:\t<table class=\"wimscenter\">\t<tr><td>\t<table class=\"wimscenter\">\t<tr>\t<td rowspan=\"3\">\\(R_{1}\\)</td>\t<td rowspan=\"3\">=</td>\t<td> <cf-slot name=\"reply1\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"50\"></cf-slot></td>\t</tr><tr>\t<td><hr /></td>\t</tr><tr>\t<td>  <cf-slot name=\"reply2\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"50\"></cf-slot></td>\t</tr></table>\t</td><td>e</td><td>\t<table class=\"wimscenter\">\t<tr>\t<td rowspan=\"3\">\\(R_{2}\\)</td>\t<td rowspan=\"3\">=</td>\t<td> <cf-slot name=\"reply3\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"50\"></cf-slot></td>\t</tr><tr>\t<td><hr /></td>\t</tr><tr>\t<td>  <cf-slot name=\"reply4\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"50\"></cf-slot></td>\t</tr></table>\t</td></tr></table>\tSostituire le lunghezze con i loro valori e ridurre le due frazioni a denominatore comune per confrontarle:\t<table class=\"wimscenter\">\t<tr><td>\t<table>\t<tr>\t<td rowspan=\"3\">\\(R_{1}\\)</td>\t<td rowspan=\"3\"> = </td>\t<td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply5\" data-size=\"5\"></span></td>\t</tr><tr>\t<td><hr /></td>\t</tr><tr>\t<td>  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply6\" data-size=\"5\"></span></td>\t</tr></table>\t</td><td>e</td><td>\t<table>\t<tr>\t<td rowspan=\"3\">\\(R_{2}\\)</td>\t<td rowspan=\"3\">=</td>\t<td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply7\" data-size=\"5\"></span></td>\t</tr><tr>\t<td><hr /></td>\t</tr><tr>\t<td>  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply8\" data-size=\"5\"></span></td>\t</tr></table>\t</td></tr></table>\tI rapporti \\(R_{1}\\) e \\(R_{2}\\)  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"choice1\" data-size=\"10\"></span>. Si deduce quindi, per  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"choice2\" data-size=\"10\"></span>, che le rette \\(\\left(Q M\\right)\\) e \\(\\left(O N\\right)\\)  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"choice3\" data-size=\"10\"></span>. ",
